{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Eirin  >Deep below the Asama Purifying Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a grueling battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However...”"
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“A torrent of impurity from the Outside World will also rush in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> What happens after that... is in your hands.”"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“Why don’t you witness for yourself how Gensokyo changes?”"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eientei."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“...”"
            ]
        },
        "56_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A house hidden in the Bamboo Forest of the Lost, where the Lunarians dwell."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Hey, you’re the one who made this Incident Stone, aren’t you?”"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“How did you reach that conclusion?”"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“I ran into a Lunarian while resolving the incident."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Plus, this stone is practically leaking the same energy from the Eternal Night Incident.”"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“You’ve dragged me into another one of your Lunarian squabbles, haven’t you?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Just like with the Ultramarine Orb Elixir back then.”"
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“Yes, you are correct in that I’ve ‘dragged you in.’”"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“However, it was not me the one who fashioned that stone."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> It was a god who is skilled at creating jewels.”"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“A god who is skilled at creating jewels... Hm, who was that again?”"
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“I merely came up with the plan to save Gensokyo and",
                "<l$> mediated between the Lunar Capital and Gensokyo.”"
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Well, whoever actually made the stone doesn’t really matter."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> More importantly, from the sound of it, you knew about this incident right from the start?”"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“Yes, the cause of the incident this time was an attack from the Outside World."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> At that rate, whatever happened to Gensokyo, the Lunar Capital wouldn’t survive."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Time was of the essence.”"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wait, an attack from outside?”"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“Most likely it was not intentional."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> However, the impurity coming from outside had reached a level",
                "<l$> not even Gensokyo could hold."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> If things continued that way, the Lunar Capital would have collapsed.”"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“So what if it collapses, was there any danger to Gensokyo?”"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“That is difficult to say."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Although Gensokyo is already full of impurity, who knows what might",
                "<l$> happen if that levee had broken."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> In any case, the plan was to borrow the power of the Stone Princess for the Lunar Capital. ",
                "<l$> That one you defeated, Ariya Iwanaga.”"
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Her power is so immense, it stops not only the impurity coming from outside,",
                "<l$> but also all of Gensokyo along with it.”"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“However, that plan also involved Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“So I entrusted Gensokyo to someone else."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> To a human who had experienced incidents all across the land."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> I believed that such human could evade the effects of stagnation, reach Ariya, and...",
                "<l$> moderate her appropriately.”"
            ]
        },
        "43_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“And that human... that was me?”"
            ]
        },
        "44_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Eirin  >“Yes, you."
            ]
        },
        "45_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> I was confident you would succeed."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thank you, Marisa Kirisame, the extraordinary magician.”"
            ]
        },
        "47_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Heh, w-well, it was nothing, really. A piece of cake."
            ]
        },
        "48_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> You can count on me if you’re ever in trouble again.”"
            ]
        },
        "49_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She didn’t fully understand everything, but being thanked doesn’t feel half bad."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“That Incident Stone was certainly the real deal."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<l$> Thanks to you, I can take some time off work. I'm grateful.”"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“Wait, return Gensokyo to normal first!”"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >“You needn’t worry. Once I withdraw my power, Gensokyo should return to normal."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >“What? ‘In my hands’...? What do you mean?”"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It’s all the more satisfying when it comes from someone who’s usually such a stuck-up."
            ]
        },
        "51_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However, she wondered why Eirin hadn’t tried to resolve the incident herself."
            ]
        },
        "52_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But as she thought back on it, she realized the incident itself",
                "had been part of Eirin’s plan."
            ]
        },
        "53_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Realizing that, Marisa couldn't help but feel angry."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Humans and Lunarians just don’t go together."
            ]
        },
        "55_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.14 — So, Was the Lunar Capital Saved?$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}